add proper support for OpenBSD specificities:

- call it again at session teardown to reset perms to root
- call setusercontext(LOGIN_SETALL|LOGIN_SETXDGENV|LOGIN_SETWSCONSGROUP) so that
  - limits from login.conf are applied,
  - XDG_RUNTIMEDIR is set up (directory created and environment variable set
  - the user is added to the wscons group
- the LOGIN__ magic number comes from the defines in login_cap.h

